    <body>
        <p><b>Sankskrit Name</b> - Ashwa Sanchalanasana</p>
        <p><b>Benefits</b> - Stretches hip flexors, strengthens legs.</p>
        <p>&#160;</p>
        <p style="font-weight: bold;">How to Practice</p>
        <ol>
            <li>
                <p>Inhale, step the right leg back.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Keep left knee bent, palms on the floor.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
                <p>Lift chest and gaze forward.</p>
            </li>
        </ol>
    </body>
</html>